+    "type": "DEPENDENCY_CACHE_IDENTITY_DRIFT",
+    "detail": "The explicit VM digest replacement in 691ab043 retained the previous vm33501fd6 cache version. A pre-existing cache prevents installation of the replacement; the ISO build also hardcodes that previous cache version."
+  },
