@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# TEMDD executable corpus
+
+`positive/` programs MUST parse and elaborate deterministically. `negative/` programs MUST fail closed. The corpus is executed by the TEMDD conformance workflow. Mutation of language semantics requires adding or updating a regression vector before adoption.
